  "details": "Within the Social page of MM, some player lists have a \"sorted by\" setting on the top right corner, and the recent update added the \"Inviteability\" option. It is useful for \"All friends\" and favorites list. \n\nHowever, in the case of \"In Instance\" category, it is pointless, and it should be removed because all players are non-invitable since you are already in the same instance. Actually, the Invite button doesn't appear in this case.",
